 "origem": "gringa: Índia, biodigestores caseiros de esterco ('gobar gas'; cerca de 5 milhões em sítios indianos, programa nacional do MNRE; modelo de tambor flutuante do KVIC) https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Biogas#India",
 "titulo": "You built a biogas digester 🐄 #engineering #shorts",
 "capa": "YOU BUILT A BIOGAS PLANT",
 "descripcion": "From a stinking pile of cow manure to free cooking gas and fertilizer, one problem at a time.\n\nWhat should we build next?\n\n#engineering #biogas #farm #offgrid #shorts",
